## Interface: 100007, 16001
## Title: Spoken Quests
## Notes: Quest dialogue read aloud through Spoken. Restores quest voiceovers on supported clients.
## Notes-deDE: Questdialoge, vorgelesen durch Spoken. Stellt die Quest-Vertonungen auf unterstützten Clients wieder her.
## Notes-esES: Diálogos de misiones leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken. Restaura las voces de misiones en clientes compatibles.
## Notes-esMX: Diálogos de misiones leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken. Restaura las voces de misiones en clientes compatibles.
## Notes-frFR: Dialogues de quêtes lus à voix haute grâce à Spoken. Restaure les voix des quêtes sur les clients pris en charge.
## Notes-ptBR: Diálogos de missões lidos em voz alta através do Spoken. Restaura as vozes de missões em clientes suportados.
## Notes-ruRU: Диалоги заданий, озвученные через Spoken. Возвращает озвучку заданий на поддерживаемых клиентах.
## Notes-koKR: Spoken으로 퀘스트 대사를 소리내어 읽습니다. 지원되는 클라이언트에서 퀘스트 음성을 복원합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 通过 Spoken 朗读任务对话。在受支持的客户端上恢复任务语音。
## Notes-zhTW: 透過 Spoken 朗讀任務對話。在受支援的客戶端上恢復任務語音。
## Version: 3.3.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Spoken_Quests\icon.tga
## SavedVariables: SpokenQuestsSettings
## OptionalDeps: Spoken, DialogueUI
# Spoken is the player this addon speaks through: optional, so a hand-installed copy
# without it loads and says what is missing; addon managers install it from the
# CurseForge dependency.
# DialogueUI, when installed, loads first so its window exists to be hooked: UI/DialogueUIBridge.lua.
## Group: Spoken
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
## X-VoiceOver-Player: 1

embeds.xml
addon.xml
